        Climate controlled transportation
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
        <svg class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-slate-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m4.5 12.75 6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
